# A) Toolchain Clang r383902 + GCC 4.9 (sesuai README)

## A1. Download clang-r383902 (AOSP archive)

```bash
mkdir -p ~/toolchains && cd ~/toolchains

curl -L -o clang-r383902.tgz \
  "https://android.googlesource.com/platform/prebuilts/clang/host/linux-x86/+archive/refs/tags/android-11.0.0_r3/clang-r383902.tar.gz"

mkdir -p linux-x86/clang-r383902
tar -xzf clang-r383902.tgz -C linux-x86/clang-r383902

~/toolchains/linux-x86/clang-r383902/bin/clang --version | head -n 2
```

## A2. Symlink clang ke path yang kernel expect

```bash
cd /mnt/DATA/SM-A135F/src/Kernel
mkdir -p toolchain/clang/host/linux-x86
ln -snf "$HOME/toolchains/linux-x86/clang-r383902" toolchain/clang/host/linux-x86/clang-r383902

toolchain/clang/host/linux-x86/clang-r383902/bin/clang --version | head -n 2
```

## A3. Clone GCC 4.9 dari CodeLinaro + checkout tag yang ada binari

```bash
cd "$HOME/toolchains"
rm -rf aarch64-linux-android-4.9
git clone https://git.codelinaro.org/clo/la/platform/prebuilts/gcc/linux-x86/aarch64/aarch64-linux-android-4.9.git aarch64-linux-android-4.9

cd aarch64-linux-android-4.9
git checkout webview-m40_r4

ls -lah bin/aarch64-linux-android-gcc
bin/aarch64-linux-android-gcc --version | head -n 1
```

## A4. Symlink GCC ke kernel tree

```bash
cd /mnt/DATA/SM-A135F/src/Kernel
mkdir -p toolchain/gcc/linux-x86/aarch64
ln -snf "$HOME/toolchains/aarch64-linux-android-4.9" toolchain/gcc/linux-x86/aarch64/aarch64-linux-android-4.9

ls -lah toolchain/gcc/linux-x86/aarch64/aarch64-linux-android-4.9/bin/aarch64-linux-android-gcc
```

