# C) KernelSU v0.9.5 + MANUAL HOOK (tanpa kprobe) — ini yang bikin boot normal & bisa lanjut

## C1. Install KernelSU legacy v0.9.5

```bash
cd /mnt/DATA/SM-A135F/src/Kernel
curl -LSs "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tiann/KernelSU/main/kernel/setup.sh" | bash -s v0.9.5
```

## C2. Defconfig: aktifkan KSU, matikan KPROBES (karena kprobe bikin bootloop)

Edit:

```bash
nano /mnt/DATA/SM-A135F/src/Kernel/arch/arm64/configs/exynos850-a13xx_defconfig
```

Pastikan:

```text
CONFIG_KSU=y
# CONFIG_KPROBES is not set
# CONFIG_KPROBE_EVENTS is not set
```

## C3. Manual hooks yang kamu inject (exec/open/read/stat)

> Catatan: kamu sudah berhasil inject dengan `perl`. Ini versi final yang benar (posisi faccessat sudah fix, vfs_read hook harus setelah deklarasi `ssize_t ret;` biar lolos C90).

### C3.1 Inject exec hook (fs/exec.c)

```bash
cd /mnt/DATA/SM-A135F/src/Kernel

# tambah extern sebelum do_execveat_common
perl -0777 -i -pe 's/(static int do_execveat_common\s*\(.*?\)\s*\{\n)/#ifdef CONFIG_KSU\nextern bool ksu_execveat_hook __read_mostly;\nextern int ksu_handle_execveat(int *fd, struct filename **filename_ptr, void *argv, void *envp, int *flags);\nextern int ksu_handle_execveat_sucompat(int *fd, struct filename **filename_ptr, void *argv, void *envp, int *flags);\n#endif\n\n$1/sms' fs/exec.c

# inject call tepat setelah "{"
perl -0777 -i -pe 's/(static int do_execveat_common\s*\(.*?\)\s*\{\n)/$1#ifdef CONFIG_KSU\n\tif (unlikely(ksu_execveat_hook))\n\t\tksu_handle_execveat(&fd, &filename, (void *)&argv, (void *)&envp, &flags);\n\telse\n\t\tksu_handle_execveat_sucompat(&fd, &filename, (void *)&argv, (void *)&envp, &flags);\n#endif\n/sms' fs/exec.c
```

### C3.2 Inject faccessat hook (fs/open.c) — versi final yang benar

```bash
cd /mnt/DATA/SM-A135F/src/Kernel

# extern dekat do_faccessat
perl -0777 -i -pe 's/(long do_faccessat\s*\(.*?\)\s*\{\n)/#ifdef CONFIG_KSU\nextern int ksu_handle_faccessat(int *dfd, const char __user **filename_user, int *mode, int *flags);\n#endif\n\n$1/sms' fs/open.c

# inject call hanya di dalam do_faccessat setelah lookup_flags
perl -0777 -i -pe 's/(long do_faccessat\s*\([^\)]*\)\s*\{.*?unsigned int lookup_flags\s*=\s*LOOKUP_FOLLOW;\n)/$1#ifdef CONFIG_KSU\n\tksu_handle_faccessat(&dfd, &filename, &mode, NULL);\n#endif\n/sms' fs/open.c
```

### C3.3 Inject vfs_read hook (fs/read_write.c) — harus setelah `ssize_t ret;`

```bash
cd /mnt/DATA/SM-A135F/src/Kernel

# extern sebelum vfs_read
perl -0777 -i -pe 's/(ssize_t vfs_read\s*\(.*?\)\s*\{\n)/#ifdef CONFIG_KSU\nextern bool ksu_vfs_read_hook __read_mostly;\nextern int ksu_handle_vfs_read(struct file **file_ptr, char __user **buf_ptr, size_t *count_ptr, loff_t **pos);\n#endif\n\n$1/sms' fs/read_write.c

# pastikan TIDAK ada hook block sebelum deklarasi ret (kalau ada, hapus)
perl -0777 -i -pe 's/\n#ifdef CONFIG_KSU\n\s*if \(unlikely\(ksu_vfs_read_hook\)\)\n\s*ksu_handle_vfs_read\(&file, &buf, &count, &pos\);\n#endif\n/\n/sm' fs/read_write.c

# inject hook setelah "ssize_t ret;"
perl -0777 -i -pe 's/(ssize_t vfs_read\s*\(.*?\)\s*\{\s*\n\s*ssize_t ret;\n)/$1\n#ifdef CONFIG_KSU\n\tif (unlikely(ksu_vfs_read_hook))\n\t\tksu_handle_vfs_read(&file, &buf, &count, &pos);\n#endif\n/sms' fs/read_write.c
```

### C3.4 Inject stat hook (fs/stat.c)

```bash
cd /mnt/DATA/SM-A135F/src/Kernel

# extern sebelum vfs_statx
perl -0777 -i -pe 's/(int vfs_statx\s*\(.*?\)\s*\{\n)/#ifdef CONFIG_KSU\nextern int ksu_handle_stat(int *dfd, const char __user **filename_user, int *flags);\n#endif\n\n$1/sms' fs/stat.c

# inject call setelah lookup_flags
perl -0777 -i -pe 's/(unsigned int lookup_flags\s*=\s*LOOKUP_FOLLOW\s*\|\s*LOOKUP_AUTOMOUNT;\n)/$1#ifdef CONFIG_KSU\n\tksu_handle_stat(&dfd, &filename, &flags);\n#endif\n/sms' fs/stat.c
```

### C3.5 Verifikasi hook masuk

```bash
cd /mnt/DATA/SM-A135F/src/Kernel
grep -n "ksu_handle_execveat" fs/exec.c | head
grep -n "ksu_handle_faccessat" fs/open.c | head
grep -n "ksu_handle_vfs_read" fs/read_write.c | head
grep -n "ksu_handle_stat" fs/stat.c | head
```

