# E) Flash via Heimdall — worked (split step)

## E1. Extract STOCK dtbo/vbmeta for “safe” flashing

```bash
cd /mnt/DATA/SM-A135F/raw
mkdir -p stock_fix && cd stock_fix

tar -xvf ../AP_*.tar.md5 dtbo.img.lz4 vbmeta.img.lz4
lz4 -d dtbo.img.lz4 dtbo_stock.img
lz4 -d vbmeta.img.lz4 vbmeta_stock.img
```

## E2. Flash BOOT then DTBO+VBMETA (Download Mode)

```bash
cd /mnt/DATA/SM-A135F/raw/stock_fix

sudo heimdall flash --BOOT /mnt/DATA/SM-A135F/raw/work_ap/boot_manualksu.img --no-reboot
sudo heimdall flash --DTBO dtbo_stock.img --VBMETA vbmeta_stock.img --resume
```

> Kalau muncul `Failed to receive session end confirmation!`, biasanya tetap sukses. Force reboot: **Vol Down + Power** 10–15 detik.

