# F) vbmeta disable (optional) — worked via avbtool (AOSP)

> Ini opsional. Kamu sempat buat vbmeta disabled pakai flags yang benar.

## F1. Get avbtool

```bash
mkdir -p ~/android-tools && cd ~/android-tools
git clone https://android.googlesource.com/platform/external/avb
```

## F2. Build vbmeta_disabled.img

```bash
cd /mnt/DATA/SM-A135F/raw/work_ap

lz4 -d vbmeta.img.lz4 vbmeta.img

python3 ~/android-tools/avb/avbtool.py make_vbmeta_image \
  --output vbmeta_disabled.img \
  --include_descriptors_from_image vbmeta.img \
  --set_hashtree_disabled_flag \
  --set_verification_disabled_flag

python3 ~/android-tools/avb/avbtool.py info_image --image vbmeta_disabled.img | head -n 80
```

